# Line endings are preserved for files whose bytes matter to the consumer.
#
# The container entrypoint is executed by /bin/sh inside a Linux image. With
# core.autocrlf=true (the default on Windows) git would store and check it out with CRLF,
# and the container would fail at start-up with a message that has nothing to do with the
# script ("not found" pointing at the shebang).
docker/*.sh text eol=lf
